  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 909.02 Waiver",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 909.02 Waiver. A person who is not physically qualified to drive due to having a physical deficiency, as listed in 49 CFR 391.41(b)(1)-(13), but who is qualified to drive a commercial motor vehicle pursuant to 49 CFR 391.11 and has not been disqualified pursuant to 49 CFR 391.15, shall be authorized to drive a commercial motor vehicle if the commissioner grants a waiver pursuant to Saf-C 909.09.\n\nSource. #8404, eff 8-2-05 (from Saf-C 908.02); ss by #10215, eff 10-25-12; ss by #13684, eff 7-17-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c900.html"
